{
  "en": [
    {
      "partOfSpeech": "Verb",
      "language": "English",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt26\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/stretch\" title=\"stretch\">stretch</a> out, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/open\" title=\"open\">open</a> out (a material etc.) so that it more fully covers a given area of space. <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r90144991\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\" about=\"#mwt27\">.mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}</style>",
          "parsedExamples": [
            {
              "example": "He <b>spread</b> his newspaper on the table."
            }
          ],
          "examples": [
            "He <b>spread</b> his newspaper on the table."
          ]
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt30\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/extend\" title=\"extend\">extend</a> (individual rays, limbs etc.); to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/stretch\" title=\"stretch\">stretch</a> out in varying or opposing directions. <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\" about=\"#mwt31\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\"> <span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\" about=\"#mwt33\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><span class=\"inflection-of-conjoined\">simple <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#past_tense\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">past</a></span> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#past_tense\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">past</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#participle\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">participle</a> of <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"en\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/spread#English\" class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\">spread</a></i></span></span><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:Forms_linking_to_themselves#SPREAD\" about=\"#mwt33\">",
          "parsedExamples": [
            {
              "example": "I <b>spread</b> my arms wide and welcomed him home."
            }
          ],
          "examples": [
            "I <b>spread</b> my arms wide and welcomed him home."
          ]
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt35\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/disperse\" title=\"disperse\">disperse</a>, to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/scatter\" title=\"scatter\">scatter</a> or distribute over a given area. <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\" about=\"#mwt36\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\">",
          "parsedExamples": [
            {
              "example": "I <b>spread</b> the rice grains evenly over the floor."
            }
          ],
          "examples": [
            "I <b>spread</b> the rice grains evenly over the floor."
          ]
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt40\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/proliferate\" title=\"proliferate\">proliferate</a>; to become more widely present, to be <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/disseminated\" title=\"disseminated\">disseminated</a>. <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\" about=\"#mwt41\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\">"
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt46\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/disseminate\" title=\"disseminate\">disseminate</a>; to cause to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/proliferate\" title=\"proliferate\">proliferate</a>, to make (something) widely known or present. <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\" about=\"#mwt47\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\">",
          "parsedExamples": [
            {
              "example": "The missionaries quickly <b>spread</b> their new message across the country."
            }
          ],
          "examples": [
            "The missionaries quickly <b>spread</b> their new message across the country."
          ]
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt51\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To take up a larger area or space; to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/expand\" title=\"expand\">expand</a>, be extended. <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\" about=\"#mwt52\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\">",
          "parsedExamples": [
            {
              "example": "I dropped my glass<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">;</span> the water <b>spread</b> quickly over the tiled floor."
            }
          ],
          "examples": [
            "I dropped my glass<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">;</span> the water <b>spread</b> quickly over the tiled floor."
          ]
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt56\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/smear\" title=\"smear\">smear</a>, to distribute in a thin layer. <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\" about=\"#mwt57\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\">",
          "parsedExamples": [
            {
              "example": "She liked to <b>spread</b> butter on her toast while it was still hot."
            }
          ],
          "examples": [
            "She liked to <b>spread</b> butter on her toast while it was still hot."
          ]
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt60\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/cover\" title=\"cover\">cover</a> (something) with a thin layer of some substance, as of butter. <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\" about=\"#mwt61\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\">",
          "parsedExamples": [
            {
              "example": "He always <b>spreads</b> his toast with <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/peanut_butter#English\" title=\"peanut butter\">peanut butter</a> and strawberry jam."
            }
          ],
          "examples": [
            "He always <b>spreads</b> his toast with <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/peanut_butter#English\" title=\"peanut butter\">peanut butter</a> and strawberry jam."
          ]
        },
        {
          "definition": "To prepare; to set and furnish with provisions.",
          "parsedExamples": [
            {
              "example": "to <b>spread</b> a table"
            }
          ],
          "examples": [
            "to <b>spread</b> a table"
          ]
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt66\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To open one’s <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/leg\" title=\"leg\">legs</a>, especially for <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/sexual\" title=\"sexual\">sexual</a> favours. <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\" about=\"#mwt67\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\">"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "partOfSpeech": "Noun",
      "language": "English",
      "definitions": [
        {
          "definition": "The act of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/spreading\" title=\"spreading\">spreading</a>."
        },
        {
          "definition": "Something that has been spread."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt470\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A layout, pattern or design of cards arranged for a reading."
        },
        {
          "definition": "An <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/expanse\" title=\"expanse\">expanse</a> of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/land\" title=\"land\">land</a>."
        },
        {
          "definition": "A large tract of land used to raise livestock; a cattle ranch."
        },
        {
          "definition": "A piece of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/material\" title=\"material\">material</a> used as a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/cover\" title=\"cover\">cover</a> (such as a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/bedspread\" title=\"bedspread\">bedspread</a>)."
        },
        {
          "definition": "A large <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/meal\" title=\"meal\">meal</a>, especially one laid out on a table."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt473\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> Any form of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/food\" title=\"food\">food</a> designed to be <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/spread#Verb\" class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\">spread</a>, such as <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/butter\" title=\"butter\">butters</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/jam\" title=\"jam\">jams</a>."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt475\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A set of multiple <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/torpedo\" title=\"torpedo\">torpedoes</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/launch\" title=\"launch\">launched</a> on <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/side-by-side\" title=\"side-by-side\">side-by-side</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/slowly\" title=\"slowly\">slowly</a>-<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/diverge\" title=\"diverge\">diverging</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/path\" title=\"path\">paths</a> toward one or more <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/enemy\" title=\"enemy\">enemy</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/ship\" title=\"ship\">ships</a>."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt477\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <span class=\"Latn\" lang=\"en\" about=\"#mwt478\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/food#English\" title=\"food\">Food</a></span> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/improvise\" title=\"improvise\">improvised</a> by <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/inmate\" title=\"inmate\">inmates</a> from various ingredients to relieve the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/tedium\" title=\"tedium\">tedium</a> of prison food."
        },
        {
          "definition": "An <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/item\" title=\"item\">item</a> in a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/newspaper\" title=\"newspaper\">newspaper</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/magazine\" title=\"magazine\">magazine</a> that occupies more than one column or page."
        },
        {
          "definition": "Two facing <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/page\" title=\"page\">pages</a> in a book, newspaper etc."
        },
        {
          "definition": "A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/numerical\" title=\"numerical\">numerical</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/difference\" title=\"difference\">difference</a>."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt480\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A measure of how far the data tend to deviate from the average.",
          "parsedExamples": [
            {
              "example": "The <b>spread</b> is usually measured using standard deviation and variance."
            }
          ],
          "examples": [
            "The <b>spread</b> is usually measured using standard deviation and variance."
          ]
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt482\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/difference\" title=\"difference\">difference</a> between the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/wholesale\" title=\"wholesale\">wholesale</a> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/retail\" title=\"retail\">retail</a> prices."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt483\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/difference\" title=\"difference\">difference</a> between the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/price\" title=\"price\">price</a> of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/futures\" title=\"futures\">futures</a> month and the price of another month of the same <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/commodity\" title=\"commodity\">commodity</a>."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt484\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/purchase\" title=\"purchase\">purchase</a> of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/futures_contract\" title=\"futures contract\">futures contract</a> of one delivery month against the sale of another futures delivery month of the same <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/commodity\" title=\"commodity\">commodity</a>."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt485\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/purchase\" title=\"purchase\">purchase</a> of one delivery month of one <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/commodity\" title=\"commodity\">commodity</a> against the sale of that same delivery month of a different commodity."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt486\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> An <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/arbitrage\" title=\"arbitrage\">arbitrage</a> transaction of the same commodity in two markets, executed to take advantage of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/profit\" title=\"profit\">profit</a> from price discrepancies."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt487\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The difference between <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/bid_price\" title=\"bid price\">bidding</a> and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/asking_price\" title=\"asking price\">asking price</a>."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt488\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/difference\" title=\"difference\">difference</a> between the prices of two similar items."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt489\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> An unlimited expanse of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/discontinuous\" title=\"discontinuous\">discontinuous</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/point\" title=\"point\">points</a>."
        },
        {
          "definition": "The <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/surface\" title=\"surface\">surface</a> in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/proportion\" title=\"proportion\">proportion</a> to the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/depth\" title=\"depth\">depth</a> of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/cut\" title=\"cut\">cut</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/gemstone\" title=\"gemstone\">gemstone</a>."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"mw-empty-elt\" about=\"#mwt490\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><link rel=\"mw:PageProp/Category\" href=\"./Category:en:Writing#SPREAD\"></span> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/excessive\" title=\"excessive\">Excessive</a>&nbsp;<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/width\" title=\"width\">width</a> of the <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/trail\" title=\"trail\">trails</a> of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/ink\" title=\"ink\">ink</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/write\" title=\"write\">written</a> on overly <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/absorbent\" title=\"absorbent\">absorbent</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/paper\" title=\"paper\">paper</a>."
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt491\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> The difference between the teams' final scores at the end of a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/sport#Noun\" title=\"sport\">sport</a> match."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "partOfSpeech": "Verb",
      "language": "English",
