          "definition": ""
        },
        {
          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/speedread#Verb\" title=\"speedread\">speedread</a>; to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/recite#Verb\" title=\"recite\">recite</a> one's <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/argument#Noun\" title=\"argument\">arguments</a> at an extremely fast pace."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
