          "definition": "<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt719\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> the difference between <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/return\" title=\"return\">returns</a> or between <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/quotation\" title=\"quotation\">quotations</a> of multiple <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/securities\" title=\"securities\">securities</a> or of the same security over the course of a day"
